                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Mumbai's jewelry market position within India?</h3>
                                        <p>India's jewelry capital. Zaveri Bazaar handles ~65% of India's gold trade. BKC hosts premier retail + luxury flagship stores. Andheri + Powai + Malad host the D2C brand ecosystem (Melorra, Aria, Palmonas, GIVA HQ). Mumbai jewelry brands compete for the most sophisticated jewelry buyers in India.</p>
                                        <h3>Do we need a Mumbai-based agency or does a remote India agency work?</h3>
                                        <p>Hybrid (Mumbai HQ + remote execution pod) is the winning model. Local strategist + senior creative lead + monthly in-person QBR + on-site shoots + creator sourcing, remote performance + SEO + content for daily execution. Pure remote works for smaller D2C brands; pure local can lack execution scale.</p>
                                        <h3>What languages should creative be produced in for Mumbai jewelry marketing?</h3>
                                        <p>English + Hindi + Marathi + Gujarati. Marathi + Gujarati creative reaches culturally-aligned Mumbai buyer segments effectively. Multilingual creative outperforms English-only by 25-40% on cost + engagement for local + regional catchment.</p>
                                        <h3>How much should a Mumbai-based D2C jewelry brand budget for a marketing agency?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 65K-Rs 1.5 lakh / month for Starter (Rs 25L-2 Cr revenue). Rs 1.5-3.5 lakh / month for Growth (Rs 2-25 Cr). Rs 4 lakh+ / month for Enterprise. Ad spend separate. Mumbai overhead may add 10-20% to remote-agency-equivalent pricing due to city talent + real estate costs.</p>
                                        <h3>What compliance considerations are specific to Mumbai jewelry brands?</h3>
                                        <p>BIS registration via Mumbai BIS office + hallmarking at Mumbai AHCs (Assay + Hallmarking Centres) in Kalbadevi + Zaveri Bazaar. GST registration under Maharashtra jurisdiction. IEC for cross-border. Import + duty coordination via JNPT / Mumbai Port + Nhava Sheva. See our <a href="/resources/bis_hallmarking_huid_d2c_jewelry_compliance.php">BIS + HUID compliance guide</a>.</p>
                                        <h3>Which Mumbai jewelry brands has ITD GrowthLabs worked with?</h3>
                                        <p>Fabelia (case study published). Additional client references available under NDA on request during discovery call. City-specific jewelry marketing playbooks published for Mumbai + GCC. Full portfolio review available on the discovery call &mdash; book via Calendly on our <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-jewelry-brands.php">jewelry vertical page</a>.</p>
                                        <h3>Do you handle bridal + wedding jewelry marketing for Mumbai brands?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes. Mumbai weddings are among India's highest-budget. Our bridal jewelry playbook covers content + video consultation + wedding-blogger partnerships + bridal-magazine placement + calendar-aware (Nov-Feb wedding season) campaign planning. See our <a href="/resources/jewelry_influencer_marketing_micro_macro.php">jewelry influencer marketing playbook</a> for the bridal + wedding creator network.</p>
                                        <h3>How does the discovery + engagement process work with ITD?</h3>
                                        <p>30-min discovery call (Calendly link) to understand your brand + funnel + goals. Followed by scoped proposal within 3 business days with 90-day plan + budget breakdown + KPIs + team + timeline. 6-month master service agreement with month-to-month cancellation after month 3 if milestones missed. Ad spend transparent pass-through billing.</p>
